  "description": "Its name, lurking in the darkness and coiling around your ankle, is love, or obsession, or perhaps desire…\n\nKwon Hyuksoo, a club waiter, falls in love at first sight after locking eyes with a passing man named Nam Suhwa.\nHis senior, Jihoon, warns him that there’s something strange about Suhwa, but Hyuksoo ignores the advice as if under a spell. He finds himself drawn deeper and deeper to Suhwa, whose languid, seductive allure is impossible to resist.\n\nA high-intensity tentacle thriller by creator Dotgabi.",
